#: of palm_tracer.Tools.Ui.make_info_grid:1
msgid "Construit une colonne d'informations structurée sous forme de :class:`QGridLayout`."
msgstr "Builds a column of information structured as a :class:`QGridLayout`."

#: of palm_tracer.Tools.Ui.make_info_grid:3
msgid "La grille est composée de : un titre de section (ligne 0), un séparateur horizontal, plusieurs lignes ``label / value`` (et éventuellement ``unit``)."
msgstr "The grid consists of: a section title (row 0), a horizontal separator, and several ``label / value`` rows (and possibly ``unit``)."

#: of palm_tracer.Tools.Ui.make_info_grid:5
msgid "La colonne ``value`` est extensible afin de conserver un alignement propre, tandis que les labels et unités gardent leur taille naturelle."
msgstr "The ``value`` column is resizable to maintain proper alignment, while labels and units retain their natural size."

#: of palm_tracer.Tools.Ui.make_info_grid:7
msgid "Dictionnaire décrivant les lignes à afficher. Chaque entrée doit contenir :          - ``\"label\"`` : :class:`QLabel` (libellé) ;         - ``\"value\"`` : :class:`QLabel` (valeur associée) ;         - optionnellement ``\"unit\"`` : :class:`QLabel` (unité) si ``size == 3`` ;         - optionnellement ``\"tips\"`` : ``str`` (tooltip appliqué au label)."
msgstr "Dictionary describing the rows to display. Each entry must contain:          - ``\"label\"``: :class:`QLabel` (label);         - ``\"value\"``: :class:`QLabel` (associated value);         - optionally ``\"unit\"``: :class:`QLabel` (unit) if ``size == 3``;         - optionally ``\"tips\"``: ``str`` (tooltip applied to the label)."

#: of palm_tracer.Tools.Ui.make_info_grid:8
msgid "Dictionnaire décrivant les lignes à afficher. Chaque entrée doit contenir :"
msgstr "Dictionary describing the lines to display. Each entry must contain:"

#: of palm_tracer.Tools.Ui.make_info_grid:11
msgid "``\"label\"`` : :class:`QLabel` (libellé) ;"
msgstr "``\"label\"``: :class:`QLabel` (label);"

#: of palm_tracer.Tools.Ui.make_info_grid:12
msgid "``\"value\"`` : :class:`QLabel` (valeur associée) ;"
msgstr "``\"value\"``: :class:`QLabel` (associated value);"

#: of palm_tracer.Tools.Ui.make_info_grid:13
msgid "optionnellement ``\"unit\"`` : :class:`QLabel` (unité) si ``size == 3`` ;"
msgstr "optionally ``\"unit\"``: :class:`QLabel` (unit) if ``size == 3``;"

#: of palm_tracer.Tools.Ui.make_info_grid:14
msgid "optionnellement ``\"tips\"`` : ``str`` (tooltip appliqué au label)."
msgstr "optionally ``\"tips\"``: ``str`` (tooltip applied to the label)."

#: of palm_tracer.Tools.Ui.make_info_grid:15
msgid "Titre de la colonne affichée en haut de la grille."
msgstr "Column title displayed at the top of the grid."

#: of palm_tracer.Tools.Ui.make_info_grid:16
msgid "Nombre de colonnes : ``2`` → ``label | value``, ``3`` → ``label | value | unit``."
msgstr "Number of columns: ``2`` → ``label | value``, ``3`` → ``label | value | unit``."

#: of palm_tracer.Tools.Ui.make_info_grid:17
msgid "Parent Qt du layout (optionnel)."
msgstr "Qt parent of the layout (optional)."

#: of palm_tracer.Tools.Ui.make_info_grid:18
